    commands: "M4.75 5.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 6.5 4h11a1.75 1.75 0 0 1 1.75 1.75v12.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 17.5 20h-11a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.75-1.75V5.75ZM9 4v16M12.5 8h3.75M12.5 12h3.75M12.5 16h2.5";
